@startuml
' Architecture ticket 496; supports Product UC-001, UC-002, UC-003.
title Ticket 496 — Evaluation harness module responsibilities
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
actor CLI
component "bin/harness-eval.mjs" as EvalCLI
component EvalRunner
component CaseLoader
component WorkspaceManager
component WorktreeManager
component CodexProcessAdapter
component ExternalSystemPort
component GitHubStub
component RecordingAdapter
component ExplicitIntegrationAdapter
component EventJournal
component HardGateGrader
component OutcomeGrader
component QualityGrader
component EfficiencyCollector
component Report
component "real Codex / harness" as RealHarness
CLI --> EvalCLI : invokes
EvalCLI --> EvalRunner : starts case
EvalRunner --> CaseLoader : loads case
EvalRunner --> WorkspaceManager : preflight / provision
WorkspaceManager --> WorktreeManager : parallel plan worktrees
EvalRunner --> CodexProcessAdapter : launch / observe / terminate
CodexProcessAdapter --> RealHarness : process lifecycle
EvalRunner --> ExternalSystemPort : normalized requests/responses
ExternalSystemPort <|.. GitHubStub
ExternalSystemPort <|.. RecordingAdapter
ExternalSystemPort <|.. ExplicitIntegrationAdapter
EvalRunner --> EventJournal : append / replay / checkpoint
EvalRunner --> HardGateGrader : deterministic gates
EvalRunner --> OutcomeGrader : deterministic outcome
EvalRunner --> QualityGrader : artifact bundle
EvalRunner --> EfficiencyCollector : collect evidence
EvalRunner --> Report : combines final result
note right of ExternalSystemPort
Only external boundary; default mutation deny.
Replay mismatch/missing has no live fallback.
end note
note right of WorktreeManager
Detached worktrees for independently runnable parallel plans from one fixed group base.
Sequential chains share an execution line; no commit/branch/merge ownership or implicit force cleanup.
end note
note bottom of EventJournal
Append-only JSONL, replay, quarantine, checkpoint projection; evidence is outside worktree.
end note
@enduml
